5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a logical approach to the fee structure. I suggest we look at the data regarding how people join and the history of our membership.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. A rational analysis of the workload and the finances is essential to ensure the system is sustainable for the committee.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,It would be wise to see who is actually using the club. I am interested in the disparity between attendance and payment.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's not overcomplicate it. We just need to know why people are hesitant and what the actual costs are.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm tired of guessing! We need to know exactly what's going out and what's coming in so we don't mess up the budget again.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the taster evening forms from non-joiners and the minute books from the named-grade years to see what affects recruitment.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I'll look into the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the sign-up records for mid-year joiners to assess the administrative burden.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I'll check the tally of the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record to see who is doing the heavy lifting.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'll investigate the weekday turnout since the summer outings and the quieter members at the winter social to understand the current mood.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm going for the last year's ledger of outgoings and the bank statements on last year's renewals. I want the hard numbers.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
